21\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to sort out who's coming along before I organise snacks, so who'll be at the draughts?\", \"Hang on, something just popped into my head — have I got any notes about pewter? I was sure I'd written something down.\", \"Okay, back to the draughts thing — I messaged Nesrin earlier about it, so can you log that for me?\", \"Oh no, sorry, I've mixed people up there — it was actually Itzel I messaged, not them.\"], [\"Could you tell me who will be at the draughts, please?\", \"Sorry, just a quick question first — do I have any notes about pewter, please?\", \"Returning to the draughts — Nesrin was messaged by me today; would you mind logging that?\", \"Apologies, I made a mistake — it was Itzel, not them. Could you correct that, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0022\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's… what's still on my list?\", \"ok and which of those don't have, uh, a due date?\", \"hmm the insure one, what are the, umm, steps for it?\", \"ok can you move the post one to… to thursday?\", \"oh no wait, wrong one, I meant the first one\"], [\"I've got a free afternoon and want to knock a few things off, so what's still sitting on my to-do list?\", \"Some of those feel like they've been floating forever, so which ones don't have a due date at all?\", \"The insure one keeps nagging at me and I'm not sure where to begin, so can you tell me its steps?\", \"I definitely won't get to the post one soon, so could you shift it to thursday instead?\", \"Ugh, sorry, I picked the wrong one there — I actually meant the first one, not that.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0023\", \"v\": [[\"umm so Priskel, I messaged them today, can you log that?\", \"oh and different thing, do I have any, uh, paperwork for the copperplate expense?\", \"ah nah, just leave it\", \"ok umm can you settle up with everyone in Farton who, uh, owes me?\", \"and can you show me the pictures I, umm, favourited?\"], [\"Priskel — messaged today, log it\", \"any paperwork for the copperplate expense?\", \"nah, leave it\", \"settle up with all of Farton who owe me\", \"my favourite pics\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0024\", \"v\": [[\"Priskel next door — messaged today, log it\"], [\"Could you please log that Priskel, the neighbour next door, was messaged by me today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0025\", \"v\": [[\"how many open tasks have i got\", \"which expenses are in the Farton trip group\", \"any portal stuff in my locker?\", \"note to self: Eskil likes the cockpit\"], [\"I feel like my to-do list has been growing out of control lately, so how many open tasks do I actually have right now?\", \"I'm trying to work out who paid for what on that holiday, so which expenses are in the Farton trip group?\", \"I keep forgetting my logins for various sites, so which items in my locker mention portal?\", \"Before I forget, since his birthday's coming up at some point — note to self: Eskil likes the cockpit.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0026\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what my first appointment is on friday, please?\"], [\"umm what's my… what's my first appointment friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0027\", \"v\": [[\"which events is Eskil Carrington on\", \"wait quick one, anything to do w Gaman?\", \"ok back to Eskil's stuff, the billiards one, who else is gonna be there\", \"also got any paperwork for the jellyfish expense\", \"what do my pictures have on it\"], [\"umm which calendar events is Eskil Carrington on?\", \"oh hang on, uh, can you show me anything to do with Gaman?\", \"ok right, back to Eskil's events — the, umm, billiards one, who else is gonna be there?\", \"different thing, do I have any, uh, paperwork for the jellyfish expense?\", \"and what've my pictures got on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0028\", \"v\": [[\"tasks due this week — how many?\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out whether I can take on anything extra, so how many tasks have I got due this week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0029\", \"v\": [[\"how many docs in Tartu flat?\", \"forget it\"], [\"I'm getting the rental paperwork together for t